{:edb/db-before-t 4908 :edb/db-after-t 4909 :edb/tx-data [[13194139538221 50 #inst "2026-10-20T00:59:37.861Z" 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186108045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186108046 13194139538221 17592186576411 false] [17592186108045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186653061 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186108045 1078 #edb/ref 17592186108050 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186109945 1078 #edb/ref 17592186109946 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186110593 1038 #edb/ref 17592186653068 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186111048 1074 "First, we take $\\log_3$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n3^{x-2}&=6\\\\\n\\log_3\\left(3^{x-2}\\right)&=\\log_3(6).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing $\\log_b(b^c)=c$ gives $x-2=\\log_3(6)$. Adding $2$ to both sides, we obtain\n\n$$\nx=\\log_3(6)+2.\n$$" 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186111370 1074 "We take $\\log_5$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n5^x&=15\\\\\n\\log_5\\left(5^x\\right)&=\\log_5(15).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing $\\log_b(b^c)=c$, we obtain the exact solution\n\n$$\nx=\\log_5(15).\n$$" 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653061 1080 "x=\\log_3(2)-3" 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653061 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653061 1083 #uuid "3fa04703-fe2d-542a-8f19-112ed7778aa6" 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653062 1080 "x=\\log_4(7)+3" 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653062 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653062 1083 #uuid "53b750a1-8105-5e33-9337-52923d87b0d8" 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653063 1080 "x=\\log_4(10)" 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653063 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653063 1083 #uuid "54b5c430-53fb-585d-9b74-100c2bc3eff1" 13194139538221 17592186576411 true] [17592186653064 1080 "x=\\frac{\\log_4(7)}{3}" 13194139538